{"data":{"product":{"id":"gid://shopify/Product/7536086089825","title":"Pastel Bloom Mommy and Me Dresses - Sleeveless Sundress","handle":"pastel-bloom-mommy-and-me-dresses","status":"ACTIVE","publishedAt":"2026-04-23T15:12:54Z","onlineStoreUrl":"https://www.dresslikemommy.com/products/pastel-bloom-mommy-and-me-dresses","descriptionHtml":"<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Fabric:</strong> Lightweight polyester fabric with an airy drape that feels breezy and photo-ready for warm days.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Family story:</strong> A soft matching sundress moment for mom and daughter, made for beach walks, resort dinners, birthdays, and vacation photos.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Print:</strong> \"Pastel Bloom\" mixes watercolor florals, pastel petals, and soft greenery over a light cream ground.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Design details:</strong> Sleeveless cut, tie-front neckline, gently gathered waist, and a floaty skirt that moves beautifully in the breeze.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Care:</strong> Machine wash cold on gentle, line dry, do not bleach, and use a cool iron inside-out if needed.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Size range:</strong> Girls Child 3 Years to Child 12 Years; Mother M to Mother L.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Size Chart - Dress</h3>\n<table id=\"size-chart\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Size</th>\n      <th>Age</th>\n      <th>Weight (kg/lbs)</th>\n      <th>Height (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Chest/Bust (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Skirt Length (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Pant/Short or - (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Hip (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Waist (cm/in)</th>\n      <th>Garment Length (cm/in)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 3 Years</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>14-16 kg / 31-35 lbs</td>\n<td>95-105 cm / 37-41 in</td>\n<td>69 cm / 27.2 in</td>\n<td>68 cm / 26.8 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>73 cm / 28.7 in</td>\n<td>69 cm / 27.2 in</td>\n<td>68 cm / 26.8 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Child 4 Years</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>16-19 kg / 35-42 lbs</td>\n<td>105-115 cm / 41-45 in</td>\n<td>72 cm / 28.3 in</td>\n<t