 of days that deserve a little extra softness. The watercolor floral print feels light and airy against the seaside backdrop, while the sleeveless cut and gathered waist keep the silhouette relaxed, easy, and twirl-friendly for both mom and mini.</p>\n\n<p>From beach photos to garden parties, this matching sundress set is all about effortless charm. The tie-front neckline adds a sweet detail up top, and the flowy skirt keeps every step breezy, making it an easy choice for warm-weather family moments that you want to remember.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Watercolor floral print:</strong> Soft pastel blooms and greenery create a dreamy summer look.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Breezy sleeveless fit:</strong> Lightweight woven construction keeps the silhouette easy and warm-weather friendly.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Tie-front detail:</strong> A sweet neckline accent adds polish without making the dress feel fussy.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Flowy gathered skirt:</strong> The full skirt moves beautifully for beach walks, vacations, and photos.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Mom and mini matching:</strong> Coordinated mother-and-daughter styling makes family dressing feel effortless.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Add your sizes and bring home a matching sundress set that feels ready for every sunny family plan.</p>","tags":["Beach","Bloom","Child 11-12yr","Child 2-3yr","Child 4-5yr","Child 6-8yr","Child 9-10yr","Dresses","Floral","Garden","Girl Dress","Green","https://detail.1688.com/offer/895442481104.html?","Matching Family Dress","Matching Family Dresses","Midi Dress","Midi Dresses","Mom Size L","Mom Size M","Mommy and Me","Mother Dress","Pastel","Pink","Resort","Sleeveless Dress","Summer","Sundress","Vacation","Watercolor","White","Wildflower","Yellow"],"seo":{"title":"Pastel Bloom Matching Sundress | Dress Like Mommy","description":"Lightweight woven floral mommy-and-me sundresses for mom + daughter. Sizes 3Y-12Y and Mom M-L with an airy sleeveless resort fit."},"category":{"id":"gid://